How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video.

integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Calm telephoto TV news footage of a road checkpoint on a river bridge at dusk. Start exactly at Picture 1. The uniformed personnel in protective masks stand still in a line behind the barriers, keeping traffic back; red warning lights blink slowly; a second green truck rolls slowly into place across the lanes; the stopped cars wait with their headlights on. Nothing dramatic happens; it is an orderly road closure. Slight handheld news-camera drift. This is TV news footage shown as a horizontal picture in the middle of a vertical frame with blurred fill above and below; keep that layout fixed. No text, captions or logos appear.

overall_soundscape: Engines idling, a few car horns, a truck's air brakes, distant helicopter rotor.

